                                <strong>@(InstallationLabelFor(Model.InstallLinking.ClaimedInstallations, leadInstallation.InstallationId)) · @PlatformSummary(leadInstallation.Platform, leadInstallation.Arch) · @InstallationReleaseFor(Model.InstallLinking.ClaimedInstallations, leadInstallation.InstallationId)</strong>
                            </div>
